            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "В терминалах подсказки появляются только в поле ввода ИИ-агента."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ternary 4B in 1.1 GB; measurably behind MiniCPM5 on the 17-language set (p=0.004), with the same coverage sag outside English and Western Europe (uk 62%, cs 63%)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
